</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flow-column">
<div class="flow-header opensearch">🔍 OpenSearch の世界</div>
<div class="flow-step opensearch">
<div class="flow-icon">📝</div>
<div class="flow-content">
<h4>ログ・イベントデータ</h4>
<p>アプリログ, アクセスログ, メトリクス...</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flow-arrow">⬇️</div>
<div class="flow-step opensearch">
<div class="flow-icon">⚡</div>
<div class="flow-content">
<h4>インデックス作成</h4>
<p>全文検索可能な形式で格納</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flow-arrow">⬇️</div>
<div class="flow-step opensearch">
<div class="flow-icon">🔎</div>
<div class="flow-content">
<h4>リアルタイム検索・可視化</h4>
<p>クエリで瞬時にデータ検索</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flow-arrow">⬇️</div>
<div class="flow-step opensearch">
<div class="flow-icon">🚨</div>
<div class="flow-content">
<h4>監視・アラート</h4>
