                            </td>
<td>
<span class="feature-icon">🔎</span>
                                全文検索が得意<br/>複雑なクエリ対応
                            </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>💰 料金体系</td>
<td>
<span class="feature-icon">👤</span>
